## Build

```sh
# 1. the native library (produces lib{{LIB}}.{dylib,so} / {{LIB}}.dll)
cmake -S . -B build && cmake --build build

# 2. the .NET assembly
dotnet build {{LIB}}.csproj
```

## Run

The .NET loader must find the native library at run time. Point it at the CMake
build dir (or copy `lib{{LIB}}.*` next to your executable):

```sh
# macOS
DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH=build dotnet run
# Linux
LD_LIBRARY_PATH=build dotnet run
```

