```csharp
using {{NS}};

using var p = new Person();   // IDisposable — frees the native instance
p.name = "Alice";
System.Console.WriteLine(p.greet("Hi"));
```

Boundary types: scalars, `bool`, `string`, enums (by name), and `List<…>` of
those. Members using any other type are omitted from both sides.

